  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T16:26:00.363648Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T16:43:02.886341Z",
  "totalBlocks": 34,
  "translatedBlocks": 34,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2db60eb5ab77537",
      "translationZh": "交互式图表见 https://snagnever.github.io/macstudio-local-llm/perf-lines.html",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f10f60d613a01bcd",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版 — 我在一台 M4 Max（128 GB）上，测量了五种运行时/量化组合运行同一个 Qwen3.8 27B 模型时的速度，上下文长度从 32K 一直到原生支持的 256K。两个要点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b3210029fefb337",
      "translationZh": "最快的组合取决于你的上下文长度。内置推测机制的量化方案（MTPLX，原生多 token 预测）在约 128K 以内最快 — 但在 256K 上限处，其验证步骤的性能骤降（约 7 tok/s），而普通的 oMLX 和 mlx-dspark 仍能保持约 14–15 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a53af76cdd3f7b0e",
      "translationZh": "实际使用中最大的提速来源不是量化 — 而是前缀缓存。热缓存能将 256K 下约 40 分钟的冷启动预填充变成约 2 分钟的等待。选择一个缓存确实能复用你的提示词模式的运行时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ca28a0c3f68f55a",
      "translationZh": "这三个运行时都采用无损推测解码（目标模型会验证每一个 token）。我报告两种速度：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d49b4f3108fa0212",
      "translationZh": "Decode tps = 原始生成速度（生成过程中的 tokens/s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bfd1090d5f90967e",
      "translationZh": "Effective tps = 在热缓存条件下，输出 token 数 ÷ 总实际耗时（包括预填充）。这才是你在多轮对话 / 智能体使用中真正感受到的数值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4db5319eae63931",
      "translationZh": "Decode tps — 原始生成速度（越高越好）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfbbfa0e49fcd95b",
      "translationZh": "配置 32K 64K 128K 256K",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32651cd15a8f35b6",
      "translationZh": "mlx-dspark 8 位（DFlash2）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "428f334ed7515e3b",
      "translationZh": "MTPLX 4 位（原生 MTP）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c2ff8a594e9c2be",
      "translationZh": "MTPLX 8 位（原生 MTP）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71c45567097ba640",
      "translationZh": "有效 tps——缓存已预热时，你实际感受到的速度（越高越好）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cedcc13185c3abe",
      "translationZh": "128K 时的缓存复用率（提示词被复用的比例，越高意味着重新预填充越少）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2630263bb49e844",
      "translationZh": "配置 重复 追加 中间编辑",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40819c5c719514f5",
      "translationZh": "oMLX（内容寻址 + SSD）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe5c8c9eb9d71abf",
      "translationZh": "MTPLX（RAM 会话库）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d867f570b58ebb18",
      "translationZh": "MTPLX 在出现任何差异时都会重新预填充（在提示词中间编辑 = 全量重新计算），而且其 RAM 会话库的容量必须与上下文大小相匹配——此前容量上限配置不足，导致在 128K 下追加内容/工具轮次的复用悄然失效，直到我调高了该上限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29e05066eb8b2428",
      "translationZh": "测试设备：Apple M4 Max，40 核 GPU，128 GB 统一内存，macOS 26.5.2。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5a8eeab2180d319",
      "translationZh": "模型：一个 27B 模型，五套量化/运行时技术栈。运行时：oMLX（两级分页 KV，RAM + SSD 溢出存储）、MTPLX（推测机制内置于量化方案，无外部草稿生成器）、mlx-dspark（使用外部 DFlash2 块扩散草稿生成器，目标模型为 MLX 8-bit）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "454776481106003f",
      "translationZh": "测试：在 32K/65K/128K/256K 下测试 5 种场景（冷启动 / 重复 / 追加 / 中间编辑 / 工具轮次），每次先自行预热，再测量一个请求。采用厂商采样设置（temp 1.0、top-p 0.95、top-k 20）。每个上下文长度下的解码 tps 取各场景的平均值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dffade5b58a64670",
      "translationZh": "各配置的推测机制（全部无损——输出相同，只是更快）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fd2146ef892ac13",
      "translationZh": "配置 推测引擎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64863948e5a9a88d",
      "translationZh": "未启用任何推测机制——AWQ 检查点，未记录到 MTP 接受情况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb53d32f9b50da72",
      "translationZh": "检查点中的 MTP 头（接受率约 0.85，每步约 2.6 个 token）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efc7309de84a5e70",
      "translationZh": "DFlash2 外部草稿模型（块扩散，每步约 3.2 个 token）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26f3df9750955782",
      "translationZh": "量化版本中内置的原生 MTP（深度为 3）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "711e92ca977bfecf",
      "translationZh": "注意，在短上下文下，AWQ 5-bit 即使不使用推测解码，解码速度仍然超过 oQ8e 8.6-bit——更轻量的 5-bit 权重胜过了 oQ8e 的 MTP 头。只有当 MTP 接受的 token 足够多，能够抵消更重量级的量化版本带来的开销时，它才会领先。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a84cb3815ac5bcae",
      "translationZh": "在约 128K 及以下：MTPLX 4-bit 是吞吐量之王（解码吞吐量和有效吞吐量均如此）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63c16fcd292d98ed",
      "translationZh": "达到 256K 上限时：避免使用 MTP-verify 运行时——解码速度会减半（约 7 对比约 15）；oMLX / mlx-dspark 胜出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "832511870d2e7b08",
      "translationZh": "对于智能体／多轮对话：缓存比量化更重要——而且只有 oMLX 在提示词中途被编辑后仍复用了提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8e3e16e57ffd2a2",
      "translationZh": "RAM：在 256K 时，8-bit 软件栈逼近 128 GB 上限（约 127–133 GB，开始使用交换空间）；oMLX AWQ 5-bit 是唯一仍有余量的方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "884a7d05ff7172ae",
      "translationZh": "交互式图表 + 完整方法说明：https://snagnever.github.io/macstudio-local-llm/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69c5ae2fe6eaa31b",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/vitordeas 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
